    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59903" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρηπῑδ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρηπίς</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furnish with boots</i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>put on one's boots</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>furnish with a quay</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				60.11
			</span></i>; <i>furnish with a foundation, found</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				51.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be supported</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ θατέρου σκέλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.233b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
